<h3>
	After installation
</h3>
<p>
	To set up synchronization with the Apple School Manager, store the Apple School Manager SFTP
	username and the path to a file with the password in <code>/etc/asm-connections.json</code>.
	The file can list several Apple School Manager accounts.
</p>
<p>
	The
	<a href="https://docs.software-univention.de/apple-school-manager-connector/en/" target="_blank">Apple
	School Manager Connector manual</a> describes where to obtain those credentials, which data the
	connector synchronizes, and how to configure it.
</p>
